From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Trevor Elliott <telliott@fastly.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Feb 2023 16:48:12 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Wire the JS Streams builtin into the engine and shell

--enable-js-streams (MOZ_JS_STREAMS), the build, prototype keys, realm
options, error messages, runtime and global-object hooks, shell support,
the jsapi tests and the non262 streams test, and the libpref switch.
The browser-side dom/ and testing/web-platform/meta parts of the source
commit are not in the queue.

Source commits in YurtOS/firefox (yurt dff5cf534448):
  71f34b31f32f Bring back the JS Streams implementation
    (all included paths except js/src/builtin/streams, js/public/Stream.h)
---
